  "paper_id": "asplos-2023-risotto-a-dynamic-binary-translator-for-weak-memory-mode-3b836178",
  "title": "Risotto: A Dynamic Binary Translator for Weak Memory Model Architectures",
  "abstract": "Dynamic Binary Translation (DBT) is a powerful approach to support cross-architecture emulation of unmodified binaries. However, DBT systems face correctness and performance challenges, when emulating concurrent binaries from strong to weak memory consistency architectures. As a matter of fact, we report several translation errors in QEMU, when emulating x86 binaries on Arm hosts.",
